expect(AssuranceStrictness.from_name("strict").name()).to_equal("strict")
expect(AssuranceStrictness.from_name("robust").name()).to_equal("robust")
expect(AssuranceStrictness.from_name("critical").name()).to_equal("critical")
```

</details>

